                                "sense_id": "e38cb8fa-8216-389c-8ee7-0743fbe320a7",
                                "text": "A Rolls Royce will not do if you need an economical, nippy car that is easy to park."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "35d6a603-e2b0-3674-9368-f1cf5a9fda08",
                        "entry_id": "75034652-a2c5-3f38-83a9-88ac3f8c2d8b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of the weather, rather cold."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d99b7ddb-f31b-4f86-a2fa-65b3ef21300b",
                                "sense_id": "35d6a603-e2b0-3674-9368-f1cf5a9fda08",
                                "text": "Gosh, it's a bit nippy today: I'd better wear my gloves."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f93efdb-6d96-4de0-b791-6df7dd9545fb",
                                "sense_id": "35d6a603-e2b0-3674-9368-f1cf5a9fda08",
                                "text": "Raj took a deep breath, and reached out to give Armitage the gentlest little stroke. “It’s nippy out. Let’s take him inside.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "56a3e365-22f9-3843-958a-21944cbed7f1",
                        "entry_id": "75034652-a2c5-3f38-83a9-88ac3f8c2d8b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Inclined to nip; bitey."
